Third-party components
----------------------
Nothing below is copied into this repository except where stated. Components
are downloaded when the Docker image is built (docker/Dockerfile) or when
`make deps` runs (deps.repos). Each keeps its own license.

Rescue Randy (3D model and textures)
  Author: Open Robotics. Source: Gazebo Fuel,
  https://fuel.gazebosim.org/1.0/OpenRobotics/models/Rescue%20Randy/3
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Used unmodified as the "person" in generated worlds. Fetched at Docker build
  time, not stored in this repository. Videos and images that show it carry
  the same credit.

Ultralytics YOLO11 (ultralytics Python package and yolo11n/yolo11s weights)
  License: AGPL-3.0. Weights are downloaded at image build time. The optional
  RGB detector (src/rs_perception/rs_perception/rgb_detector.py) imports
  ultralytics directly. This is one reason the project is AGPL-3.0-only.

PX4 Autopilot v1.17.0 (including the x500 model) and px4_msgs v1.17.0
  License: BSD-3-Clause. https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot,
  https://github.com/PX4/px4_msgs

Micro XRCE-DDS Agent v2.4.3
  License: Apache-2.0. https://github.com/eProsima/Micro-XRCE-DDS-Agent

mrg_slam (multi-robot graph SLAM), https://github.com/aserbremen/mrg_slam
  License: BSD-2-Clause. Copyright (c) 2019 k.koide (derived from
  hdl_graph_slam). Pinned in deps.repos.
  patches/mrg_slam-init-guess-sign.patch is a one-line modification of
  apps/scan_matching_odometry_component.cpp from this BSD-2-Clause code. The
  patch is kept for the record; the project does not apply it by default
  (see docs/PHASE_7A_REPORT.md).

ndt_omp (aserbremen fork), https://github.com/aserbremen/ndt_omp
  License: BSD-2-Clause. Copyright (c) 2019 k.koide. Pinned in deps.repos.

fast_gicp, https://github.com/SMRT-AIST/fast_gicp
  License: BSD-3-Clause. Pinned in deps.repos.

small_gicp, https://github.com/koide3/small_gicp
